  "details": "0. Dont renew VRChat+\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Go to Recent Avatars\n\n3. Select Avatar that is both in recent but also on VRC+ Favorite List\n\n4. \"Change into Avatar\" Grayed out and unclickable.\n\nEssentially if the avatar is on a VRC+ list after VRC+ ran out, you cant hit \"change into Avatar\" anymore unless you either remove it from the VRC+ List, renew VRC+ or double click the Avatar to see Avatar Details. Its in the Recent Avatar list so it shouldnt do that.\n\nThis was not like this a bunch of weeks ago, I didnt have to navigate to the Avatar Details list to change into it.\n\nIt being on my Grayed out Avatar Favs shouldnt require me to do that, and didnt prior.\n\nI do not know what build number it still worked on.",
